  "profileWhatsNewChangelogTitle": "Jerin sauye-sauye",
  "profileWhatsNewChangelogSubtitle": "Sabon sabuntawa yana bude farko. Tsofaffin sabuntawa suna nan a rufe har sai ka bude su.",
  "profileWhatsNewDateMarch2026": "Maris 2026",
  "profileWhatsNewDateFebruary2026": "Fabrairu 2026",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Title": "Ingantaccen onboarding, motsi, da widgets na sallah",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Summary": "Wannan sabuntawar ta inganta saitin farko na manhaja, ta laushi canjin shafuka, kuma ta sa widgets na sallah su zama masu natsuwa da tsari.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item1": "An hade zaben suna da Brother/Sister cikin mataki guda na onboarding, kuma an bar filin suna babu komai a matsayin tsohon saitin.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item2": "An mai da bin sawun dabi’u zabin son rai a farko, don masu amfani su iya kunna shi daga baya a yadda ya dace da su.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item3": "An saka saukar shafi mai laushi a shafukan gama-gari da onboarding, tare da cikakken girmamawa ga Reduce Motion.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item4": "An cire prayer Live Activity countdown mai canzawa kowane dakika, kuma an kara tsayayyun sarrafawa daban don Dynamic Island da widgets na lock screen.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry113Item5": "An sauƙaƙa yanayin theme domin natsattsen salo na Path of Nūr ya zama tsohon theme.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Title": "Ingantawa ga Qur’anic Arabic daga amintattun tushe",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Summary": "Abubuwan Learn Qur’anic Arabic yanzu suna amfani da tsauraran ka’idojin tushe domin misalan Qur’ani da ake gani su zama masu sauƙin tantancewa da daidaito.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item1": "An tantance haruffa, misalan kalmomi, darussan jimloli, da misalan ka’idoji domin amfani da amintattun nassosin Qur’ani inda ya dace.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item2": "An saka bayanan tushe kai tsaye a cikin tafiyar darasi domin misalai su zama masu sauƙin komawa gare su.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry112Item3": "An kulle dataset na kalmomi 100 na Qur’anic Arabic ta fuskar tushe domin duk abin da za a kara nan gaba ya bukaci source metadata.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Title": "Islamic Trivia da Knowledge Paths",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Summary": "Trivia yanzu ta fadada zuwa cikakkiyar hanyar koyo mai dauke da structured question packs da guided topic journeys.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item1": "An kara Islamic Trivia da tambayoyi masu tushen rukuni, review flow, daily quiz behavior, stats, da rewards integration.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item2": "An gabatar da Knowledge Paths don guided learning journeys masu dauke da short learning cards da staged quizzes.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry111Item3": "An fadada curated trivia packs don Prophets, Qur’an Basics, Salah, Ramadan, Du’a, Seerah, da Islamic History.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Title": "Mafi wayayyen atisayen Qur’anic Arabic",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Summary": "Koyon Qur’anic Arabic ya zama mafi adaptive, tare da review mai ma’ana da jagoranci a cikin teaching flow.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item1": "An kara Smart Daily Review system tare da spaced review da adaptive weak-area targeting.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item2": "An gabatar da memory-strength tracking, review history, da natsattsen progress visibility a teaching dashboard.",
  "profileWhatsNewEntry110Item3": "An mayar da Learn Qur’anic Arabic zuwa nasa Learn destination don ya fi sauƙin ganowa.",
  "profileComingSoonRoadmapTitle": "A cikin shirin gaba",
  "profileComingSoonRoadmapSubtitle": "Waɗannan su ne sassan da ake shiryawa domin sabuntawa na gaba.",
  "profileComingSoonCard1Title": "Zurfin jagoranci na Qur’anic Arabic",
  "profileComingSoonCard1Description": "Ana shirin kara misalai masu tabbatar da tushe, tallafin review mai ƙarfi, da karin bayyana tafiyar darasi.",
  "profileComingSoonCard2Title": "Fadada tafiyoyin trivia",
  "profileComingSoonCard2Description": "Ana shirin karin curated knowledge paths, faɗaɗa rukunai, da ingantaccen content diagnostics.",
  "profileComingSoonCard3Title": "Ingantattun prayer widgets",
  "profileComingSoonCard3Description": "Za a kara inganta lock screen da Dynamic Island, tare da tsari mafi kyau da zabukan nuni masu daidaito.",
  "profileComingSoonCard4Title": "Personalization mai laushi",
